## Debugging & Observability

Wrap all nodes with debug traces: `withDebugTrace('nodeName', nodeFn)`

Every agent node MUST log at entry and exit:

```typescript
const logger = createLogger({ correlationId: state.correlationId ?? 'unknown', userId: state.userId ?? 'unknown' });
logger.info('nodeName: entering', { messageCount: state.messages.length });
logger.info('nodeName: exiting', { result });
```

